        "reasons": {
          "overallMobile": "Two coherent complete missions, helpful assists and clear feedback; target visibility and turning/reload interpretation remain friction. Wins alone do not determine grade.",
          "controls": "Two-contact MOVE/FIRE drag worked in both patrol samples, scene turns and DASH responded, AIM visibly zoomed. Wrong turn, a NO IMPACT burst and interrupted holds limit confidence in sustained combat comfort.",
          "gameplay": "Recoveries, three coil stages and uplink formed a legible varied short loop. Assisted routes carried most traversal; free navigation, broader tactics and prolonged challenge not assessed.",
          "presentation": "Cohesive rainy teal station, distinctive relay machinery, readable weapon/impact changes and restrained results screen. Audio and hardware smoothness not assessed.",
          "usability": "Large labeled touch controls, changing route/approach action, planning map and fresh-start reset supported completion. Reload transition required observation and an extra wait.",
          "readability": "Primary objective, health/ammo and completion checks clear; small distant patrols, dark structures, tiny signs and overlapping threat cards reduced fast scene comprehension."
        }
