        "usability": 7.5,
        "readability": 7.0,
        "reasons": {
          "overallMobile": "Coherent portrait mission with useful touch assistance and strong visual identity. Manual two-contact patrol engagement and zoom were usable, but aiming around cover, direction learning and dense cues added friction. Scope is two paused emulated attempts only.",
          "controls": "MOVE plus FIRE drag, scene turn, AIM and DASH visibly responded. Wrong first swipe and cover-blocked zoom burst required correction. No successful phase evade and no uninterrupted rearming-comfort assessment.",
          "gameplay": "Observed recovery, patrol exposure, armor/open timing and deck upload form a clear loop with readable progress. Route assist eased navigation; short paused encounters limit conclusions about sustained challenge or enjoyment.",
          "presentation": "Strong teal/amber industrial storm atmosphere, coherent typography, weapon silhouette and polished terminal screen in observed scenes. Audio and hardware rendering unassessed.",
          "usability": "Explicit hold route/approach, map route, checks, TARGET DOWN and LIFT then FIRE helped recovery and progress. Dynamic cues and aiming around obstruction required attention.",
          "readability": "Large health/ammo/objectives were clear at 390x844; small distant enemies, tiny status text, nearby overlapping route/threat controls and dark cover silhouettes were less immediate."
        }
